==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|enm}}, from {{etyl|ang}} {{term|atorcoppe|ātorcoppe|spider|lang=ang}}, corresponding to {{compound|atter|gloss1=poison, venom|cop|gloss2=head}}. The latter is still to be found in the English word {{term|cobweb|lang=en}}.

